\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0{I've also provided a file called \b SPLMN001.LGL\b0 , which adds a lot of legal and medical terms from Black's Legal and Stedman's Medical dictionaries to the default American English WordStar dictionary.  To use it, copy \b SPLMN001.LGL\b0  to \b SPLMN001.DCT\b0  (overwriting the regular American English dictionary0.  To revert back to the regular American dictionary, copy \b SPLMN001.BU\b0  to \b SPLMN001.DCT\b0 .}\par
